\" data-name=\"github icon\">\n                                                    </i>\n                                                    Source\n                                                </a>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"preview-frame overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[#30363D] bg-[#0D1117]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1-11-1-2\" data-name=\"repo preview container\">\n                                    <div class=\"h-[135px] overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1-11-1-2-1\" data-name=\"preview content\">\n                                        <img alt=\"Management Desktop project presentation\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover object-center\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1-11-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"repo thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/src/assets/appvers (2).png\"/>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </article>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border border-dashed border-[#30363D] bg-[#11161D] px-4 py-4 sm:px-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1-12\" data-name=\"empty filter message\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1-12-1\" data-name=\"message container\">\n                                <span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#30363D] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1-12-1-1\" data-name=\"warning icon container\">\n                                    <i class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1-12-1-1-1\" data-lucide=\"filter-x\" data-name=\"warning icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                                <p class=\"mono text-[11px] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1-12-1-2\" data-name=\"message text\">\n                                    No repositories match this filter.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <button class=\"mono text-[11px] text-[#3FB950] hover:text-[#F0F6FC]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1-12-2\" data-name=\"clear filters button\">\n                                Clear filters\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <aside class=\"space-y-4 xl:sticky xl:top-[118px] xl:self-start\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"sidebar stats\">\n                        <div class=\"rounded-lg border border-[#30363D] bg-[#161B22] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"repository map card\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"card header\">\n                                <p class=\"mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"header label\">\n                                    repository map\n                                </p>\n                                <i class=\"h-4 w-4 text-[#7C7CFF]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-1-2\" data-lucide=\"git-branch\" data-name=\"header icon\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-5 space-y-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"card content\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#30363D] pb-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"stat row mobile\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"stat label\">\n                                        Mobile\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"mono text-[12px] text-[#F0F6FC]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"stat value\">\n                                        6\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#30363D] pb-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"stat row web\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"stat label\">\n                                        Web\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"mono text-[12px] text-[#F0F6FC]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"stat value\">\n                                        3\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#30363D] pb-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"stat row other\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"stat label\">\n                                        Other\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"mono text-[12px] text-[#F0F6FC]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"stat value\">\n                                        2\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"stat row primary language\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"stat label\">\n                                        Primary language\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"mono text-[12px] text-[#3FB950]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"stat value\">\n                                        Kotlin\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"rounded-lg border border-[#30363D] bg-[#161B22] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"topic cloud card\">\n                            <p class=\"mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"card header\">\n                                browse by topic\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"topic cloud\">\n                                <span class=\"mono rounded-full border border-[#30363D] bg-[#1F2630] px-2 py-1 text-[10px] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"topic tag\">\n                                    mobile-development\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"mono rounded-full border border-[#30363D] bg-[#1F2630] px-2 py-1 text-[10px] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"topic tag\">\n                                    ui-ux\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"mono rounded-full border border-[#30363D] bg-[#1F2630] px-2 py-1 text-[10px] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"topic tag\">\n                                    ai\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"mono rounded-full border border-[#30363D] bg-[#1F2630] px-2 py-1 text-[10px] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"topic tag\">\n                                    firebase\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"mono rounded-full border border-[#30363D] bg-[#1F2630] px-2 py-1 text-[10px] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-2-2-5\" data-name=\"topic tag\">\n                                    web\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"rounded-lg border border-[#30363D] bg-[#161B22] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"info card\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"info container\">\n                                <span class=\"mt-0.5 text-[#3FB950]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"info icon container\">\n                                    <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-3-1-1-1\" data-lucide=\"info\" data-name=\"info icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                                <p class=\"text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"info text\">\n                                    Project popularity metrics are intentionally omitted. Browse the work through its real descriptions, technologies, screens, and links.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"rounded-lg border border-[#30363D] bg-[#11161D] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-4\" data-name=\"collaboration cta card\">\n                            <p class=\"mono text-[11px] text-[#8B949E]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"cta title\">\n                                open an issue\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#F0F6FC]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"cta description\">\n                                Have a mobile product to explore?\n                            </p>\n                            <a class=\"mt-4 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-[#2EA043] px-3 py-2.5 text-[12px] font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#3FB950]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-4-3\" data-name=\"cta button\" href=\"mailto:kawtar.elgaddi@gmail.com\">\n                                <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-4-3-1\" data-lucide=\"plus\" data-name=\"cta button icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                Start a collaboration\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </aside>\n                </div>\n                <footer class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-[#30363D] pt-5 text-[11px] text-[#8B949E] sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4\" data-name=\"footer section\">\n                    <span class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"copyright text\">\n                        © Kawtar El Gaddi / developer workspace\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"build status text\">\n                        built with design → develop → integrate → test → ship\n                    </span>\n                </footer>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest\">\n</script>\n<script>\n    lucide.createIcons();\n</script>\n",
